      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "No rule may say \"these happened near each other, so they're\nrelated.\" Every rule needs a shared dimension first: same pod,\nsame node, same ReplicaSet. Time is applied afterwards and can\nonly reject.",
